{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/panel_prepared_pick

    «Usar un mensaje preparado», in the composer of a family file, above «Lo que se les dice»: one card per message of the
    centre, with its first line already written for this family. A card is a submit button: without JavaScript the page
    comes back with the text in the composer; with it, panel.js writes it at once (data-pm-escribe), keeps what was written
    to give it back with «Quitarlo», and says what is missing. The name of the chosen message travels with the form
    (preparedid), so the line of the conversation can carry it. A gap that this family has no value for stays in
    brackets, and «missing» says what to do; the server does not send a text that still has it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * list - id, name, first (its first line, filled for this family), auto, text (greeting and text, filled), missing,
      current
    * chosen - the message in the composer (id, name, missing), or false
    * settingsurl - where the messages are written, for whoever can change the settings; or empty
    * action - the address of the composer (of the page around)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "list": [{"id": 1, "name": "Gracias por la visita", "first": "Gracias por venir el viernes 27 con Vera.", "auto": true,
            "text": "Hola, Lucía:\n\nGracias por venir el viernes 27 con Vera.", "missing": "", "current": false}],
        "chosen": false,
        "settingsurl": "#", "action": "https://example.com/household.php?id=1"
    }
}}
<div class="pm-usar" role="group" aria-labelledby="pm-usar-t">
    <p class="rotulo-p" id="pm-usar-t">{{#str}}prepared_use, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p>
    <div class="pm-usar-cartas">
        {{#list}}<button class="pm-ficha" type="submit" name="prepared" value="{{id}}" formaction="{{action}}#contestar" data-pm-usar data-pm-escribe="{{text}}" data-nombre="{{name}}" data-falta="{{missing}}" aria-pressed="{{#current}}true{{/current}}{{^current}}false{{/current}}"><b>{{name}}</b><span>{{first}}</span></button>{{/list}}
    </div>
    {{#settingsurl}}<a class="enlace pm-usar-ajustes" href="{{settingsurl}}">{{#str}}prepared_settings, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</a>{{/settingsurl}}
</div>
<input type="hidden" name="preparedid" value="{{#chosen}}{{id}}{{/chosen}}" data-pm-id>
<p class="pm-elegido" data-pm-elegido{{^chosen}} hidden{{/chosen}}>{{{i.enviado}}}<span>{{#str}}prepared_chosen, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}} <b data-pm-nombre>{{#chosen}}{{name}}{{/chosen}}</b></span> <button class="enlace" type="submit" name="prepared" value="0" formaction="{{action}}#contestar" data-pm-quitar>{{#str}}prepared_unchoose, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</button></p>
<p class="aviso-suave pm-aviso" role="status" data-pm-falta{{^chosen.missing}} hidden{{/chosen.missing}}>{{{i.info}}}<span data-pm-falta-texto>{{#chosen}}{{missing}}{{/chosen}}</span></p>
